<h1>What occupational therapy helps with.</h1>
<p class="lede">“Is this even an OT thing?” is the question I get most. Here's the fuller answer — if any of it sounds like your household, it's worth a conversation.</p>
</div>
</div>

<section class="sec sec-tight" aria-labelledby="intro-h">
<div class="container narrow opening">
{# Kept in the DOM but not shown: the section still needs a programmatic label
   for aria-labelledby and the document outline, but a visible subhead here
