<section class="sec" id="waiting" aria-labelledby="waiting-h">
<div class="container">
<div class="note-block">
<h2 id="waiting-h">You don't need a diagnosis, a referral, or a waiting list place.</h2>
<p class="big">A lot of the families I speak to are in the middle of something — waiting on an assessment, waiting on an early intervention place, waiting for a pediatrician to call back. That waiting can take months, and it's often the hardest stretch.</p>
<p>You don't need a label before you can start. We can begin with what's happening right now, and if a diagnosis arrives later it changes nothing about the work we've already done. If you're already working with early intervention or your school district, this doesn't conflict — I'm glad to work alongside what's in place and coordinate with your other providers.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

